#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:1
msgid "E4217"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_guard_not_supported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:5
msgid ""
"This diagnostic described a guard on a `lexmatch` or `lexscan` case and "
"is not emitted by the current compiler. The parser now rejects this "
"syntax with [E3002](E3002.md)."
msgstr "この診断は `lexmatch` または `lexscan` のケースにガードが付いている場合を説明するもので、現在のコンパイラでは出力されません。現在はパーサーがこの構文を [E3002](E3002.md) として拒否します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:9
msgid ""
"The scanner selects a case from its regex patterns before it evaluates "
"the case body. A guard would make that selection depend on an arbitrary "
"expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String, allow : Bool) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch input {\n"
"    re\"^[a-z]+$\" if allow => \"word\"\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:20
msgid "Move the additional condition into the selected case body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4217.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn classify(input : String, allow : Bool) -> String {\n"
"  lexmatch input {\n"
"    re\"^[a-z]+$\" => if allow { \"word\" } else { \"other\" }\n"
"    _ => \"other\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
